--- !u!114 &5156140078832511293
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7823356712481774349}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a1961a55fb510de479a6a538b9615f1b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SecurityGuard
  _stoppingDistance: 0.5
  _audioSourceList:
  - {fileID: 7099434883534466167}
  - {fileID: 7837606905551321351}
  _goToList:
  - {fileID: 3586274698034050064}
  - {fileID: 953572887190550996}
  securityDialogues:
  - name: Security Guard
    sentences:
    - Hello There, My Name is Theeb, I'm Your New Security Guard. I have been assigned
      to this property and I'm being paid by the goverment.
    - So...No need to pay me, they've got that covered, I'll be watching over for
      any fussy customers.
    - I,ll be here if you need anything.
  - name: Theeb
    sentences:
    - Hey there my friend, how is your day going? hope you're day is going well...
    - I noticed that you get a lot of customers these days, how come you never run
      out of stock? if you don't mind me asking...
    - Why am I asking about it? nothing in particular just uhm ha..uhmm...
    - You know what, nevermind...I'll be around if you need anything.
    - Your Theeban is always here.
  - name: Theeb
    sentences:
    - ...
    - ...............................
    - I'm not feeling too well...
    - You know...it's weird I don't remember anything from yesterday's evening...
    - Like...I remember walking home then...I woke up in the morning on my bed, but
      I feel strange.
    - You don't happen to have any meat back there no? I'm kinda craving some...
    - Hmmm your eyes look rather glimmering today...
    - ....
    - Sorry about that, I need some time alone...
    - ...
